SUMMARY:Blithe Spirit: Theatre 98
LOCATION:Theatre 98\, Fairhope\, 350 Morphy Ave\, Fairhope\, AL 36532
DESCRIPTION:Thu to Sun through 11/1 · 7:30 PM Thu to Sat\, 2:30 PM Sun\n\n
 Noël Coward's classic ghost comedy plays at Theatre 98\, Fairhope's intim
 ate community playhouse. The remaining shows run Thursday 10/29 to Sunday 
 11/1\, which makes it an easy dressed-up date night.\n\nPrice: from $20\n\
 nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blithespirit.html
