LOCATION:West Regional Library\, 5555 Grelot Road\, Mobile\, AL 36609
DESCRIPTION:During library hours through 11/1\n\nWest Regional Library host
 s this youth exhibition tied to the Jazz Art Writers South Festival\, a pa
 rtnership between Mobile Arts Council and Amp Up Arts. More than 50 painti
 ngs by artists ages 8 to 18 line the space\, each interpreting jazz throug
 h color and line. It hangs all day during the library's own hours through 
 November 1\, so call the library to confirm them before you go.\n\nPrice: 
 No published price\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-jazz
 -art-writers-south-festival-youth-exhibi-0915.html
