SUMMARY:Lightspill (mirrored-sphere art installation)
LOCATION:Artel Gallery\, 223 Palafox Pl\, Pensacola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Thursday 10/29 to Monday 11/9 · times not posted\n\nLightspill
  is a large temporary public art installation by Friends of Downtown on th
 e front of the historic Artel Gallery building in downtown Pensacola. Hund
 reds of mirrored spheres appear to pour over the facade\, and the look cha
 nges through the day with light and weather. It's free and open to the pub
 lic\, from October 29 to November 9\, as part of Foo Foo Festival.\n\nPric
 e: Free\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-lightspill-mirr
 ored-sphere-art-ins-1029.html
