 y 11 AM\, evenings Wednesday to Saturday\n\nPainting with a Twist Pensacol
 a is an artist-led paint-and-sip studio at 4771 Bayou Blvd Suite C11 with 
 several classes every week. October has family paint days (ages 6 and up w
 ith a parent\, no alcohol)\, adult Paint & Sip and Date Night classes (age
 s 16 and up on date nights)\, Halloween-themed canvases and Paint Your Pet
 . Classes cost $35-$60 depending on the class\, and alcohol is sold on sit
 e with no BYOB.\n\nPrice: $35 per family\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventu
 res.com/events/ev-painting-with-a-twist-pensacola-pa-1003.html
