 ensacola State College stages Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Stre
 et in Ashmore Auditorium over two weekends\, October 23 to 25 and October 
 30 to November 1. The college describes the eight-time Tony Award winning 
 musical as a thriller about an exiled barber who seeks revenge on a corrup
 t system of justice. One performance falls on Halloween night.\n\nPrice: f
 rom $7\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-psc-sweeney-todd
 -1023.html
