SUMMARY:Aminah Robinson: Journeys Home at the Mobile Museum of Art
LOCATION:Mobile Museum of Art\, 4850 Museum Drive\, Mobile\, AL 36608
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday to Saturday · 10:00 AM to 5:00 PM · through 1/9\n\nAm
 inah Robinson: Journeys Home is a special exhibition at the Mobile Museum 
 of Art that draws on the artist's historical research\, folklore and perso
 nal narrative. The museum describes it as a visual memoir of her life and 
 a tableau of the African American experience. It stays open through Januar
 y 9\, 2027.\n\nPrice: from $8\n\nDetails: https://coastaleventures.com/eve
 nts/ev-mma-aminah-robinson-journeys-home-0109.html
