DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261029T170000
SUMMARY:Gateway: From Graffiti to Gallery at the Mobile Museum of Art
LOCATION:Mobile Museum of Art\, 4850 Museum Dr\, Mobile\, AL 36608
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday to Saturday · 10:00 AM to 5:00 PM\, through 9/1/2027
 \n\nThe Mobile Museum of Art traces how artists who started with graffiti 
 in New York's subways moved into galleries\, with work by Basquiat\, Harin
 g\, Scharf\, KAWS and Banksy from the Masterworks Foundation collection. T
 he show runs a full year\, Wednesday through Saturday. Mobile County resid
 ents get in free on Thursdays.\n\nPrice: from $8\n\nDetails: https://coast
 aleventures.com/events/ev-mobile-museum-gateway-exhibition-0901.html
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-mobile-museum-gateway-exhibition
 -0901.html
CATEGORIES:Arts and culture
