 llery\, 11000 University Parkway\, Pensacola\, FL 32514
DESCRIPTION:Weekdays through 11/20 · 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM\n\nMake It Last i
 s an exhibition in The Art Gallery at the UWF Center for Fine and Performi
 ng Arts\, curated by a UWF graduate. Six artists share the space\, which i
 ncludes a conversation pit in the gallery alcove and a poetry wall that vi
 sitors fill with their own work. Admission is free.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDeta
 ils: https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-uwf-make-it-last-1001.html
