DESCRIPTION:Tuesday to Saturday · 10:00 AM to 5:00 PM · through 1/30\n\nT
 imeless Hats is a special exhibition of more than two dozen hats at the Mo
 bile Museum of Art. Some were made by Mrs. Williams\, and others are hats 
 she admired and drew inspiration from for her own creations. It stays open
  through January 30\, 2027.\n\nPrice: from $8\n\nDetails: https://coastale
 ventures.com/events/ev-mma-timeless-hats-0130.html
