SUMMARY:Decorate with Us at Quayside Art Gallery
LOCATION:Quayside Art Gallery\, 17 E Zaragoza St\, Pensacola\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Daily through 11/16 · 11:00 AM to 5:00 PM\n\nQuayside Art Gall
 ery in Pensacola's historic district turns its first floor into a set of h
 ome style living spaces to show how local art fits a room. The show highli
 ghts all of the gallery's artists\, with work ranging from large paintings
  and photography to pottery\, glass\, jewelry and wooden inlaid furniture.
  It is aimed at decorators\, designers\, realtors and condo owners\, thoug
 h anyone can walk in.\n\nPrice: No published price\n\nDetails: https://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-decorate-with-us-quayside-1008.html
