SUMMARY:Make & Take Art: weekly drop-in art sessions
LOCATION:Mobile Museum of Art\, 4850 Museum Drive\, Mobile\, AL 36608
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays · 3:00 PM to 4:30 PM\n\nThe museum runs a free Thurs
 day afternoon art session most weeks\, working through materials and techn
 iques borrowed from artists on view. Projects range from geometric shape p
 ainting to a Basquiat-inspired dinosaur build. The printed schedule also l
 ists a session for September 8\, but that date falls on a Tuesday\, not a 
 Thursday\, so check with the museum first.\n\nPrice: Free\n\nDetails: http
 s://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-mobile-museum-make-take-art.html
