 la\, FL 32502
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays · 3:30 PM to 5:00 PM\n\nAfter School Art is a 16 wee
 k studio program for grades 2 through 6 at the Pensacola Museum of Art. In
 structor Marce Wagner\, known as Ms. Messy\, covers drawing\, painting and
  other 2D and 3D media. Classes meet every Thursday from August 27 through
  December 17\, with no class during Thanksgiving week. The semester costs 
 $252 for museum members and $280 for non-members\, and ends with an artwor
 k showcase for families. Scholarships are available\, though the applicati
 on deadline for this session has passed.\n\nPrice: from $280\n\nDetails: h
 ttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-after-school-art-fall-2026-0827.html
